# Copy to .env.production (or set in your host's build settings) before building for launch.
#
# VITE_SITE_URL — the public production origin, used for canonical links, Open Graph/Twitter
# URLs, the Organization JSON-LD, robots.txt and sitemap.xml.
#   • absolute https URL, no trailing path:  https://www.example.com
#   • leave empty until the domain is known: the build still works, prints a warning, and emits
#     no absolute URLs (no canonical, no og:url, no sitemap.xml).
#   • a malformed value (e.g. "example.com" or "https://example.com/home") fails the build.
VITE_SITE_URL=
